Okuih
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 22 DEAL UQAV
UQAV 10 FACE_LAST
UQAV 10 FACE_HALF
UQAV 10 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE UQAV UQAV
DEST Size < 6
$win
AND
    OR
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    OR
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL UQAV Empty
